  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Gender Inequality in Solomon Islands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides support to the Solomon Islands Government and other non-government organisations to help address gender inequality in the Solomon Islands. It has three key objectives; improving support services for survivors of gender-based violence, increasing the effective representation of women through leadership at all levels of decision making, and expanding women&#x2019;s economic opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
